# Machines

## Gripper Frame

machine:gripperFrame a ssn:System, geo:Feature ;
    rdfs:label "Gripper Frame"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The gripper frame is a base structure that is comprised of a range of grippers which are used for fixing a sheet of laminate in place."@en ;
    geo:hasSize [
        a qudt:Quantity ;
        qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:Length ;
        qudt:hasUnit unit:MilliM ;
        qudt:value 800.0
    ] ;
    geo:hasSize [
        a qudt:Quantity ;
        qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:Width ;
        qudt:hasUnit unit:MilliM ;
        qudt:value 800.0
    ] ;
    pos:hasPositionalReference pos:gripperFrameReferencePoint ;
    ssn:hasSubSystem gripper:1, gripper:2, gripper:3, gripper:4, gripper:5, gripper:6, gripper:7, gripper:8 .

pos:gripperFrameReferencePoint a pos:Origin ;
    rdfs:label "Greiferrahmen Reference Point"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Die linke, untere Ecke des Greiferrahmens bildet den Bezugspunkt für die Positionen der Greiferpunkte."@de .

## Oven

machine:oven a ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "Infrared (IR) Oven"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Infrared (IR) oven comprised of two IR fields (top and bottom)."@en ;
    ssn:hasSubSystem machine:ir_top, machine:ir_bottom .

machine:ir_top a ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "IR Field (top)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The top IR field consists of three individually controllable zones: middle, edge and corner zones for the top part of the laminat."@en ;
    ssn:hasSubSystem machine:ir_top_middle, machine:ir_top_edge, machine:ir_top_corner .

machine:ir_bottom a ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "IR Field (bottom)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The bottom IR field consists of three individually controllable zones: middle, edge and corner zones for the bottom part of the laminat."@en ;
    ssn:hasSubSystem machine:ir_bottom_middle, machine:ir_bottom_edge, machine:ir_bottom_corner .

## Press

machine:press a ssn:System ;
    rdfs:label "Press"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The press is used for forming the laminat."@en .